{"id":"wb-6-810","name":"京杭大运河","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"京杭大运河","text":"京杭大运河，位于中国东部，为大运河的一条干线。2014年，京杭大运河作为大运河的一部分，被列入世界遗产名录。京杭大运河北起北京通州五河交汇处，南至杭州，流经北京、天津、河北、山东、江苏和浙江四省二市，沟通海河、黄河、淮河、长江和钱塘江五大水系，全长1794公里。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9D%AD%E5%A4%A7%E8%BF%90%E6%B2%B3","revisionId":94273921,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94273921","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/89fa08b17b5d4dccfdb21c7b.jpg","title":"Grand_Canal_Gongchen_Hangzhou.webm","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grand_Canal_Gongchen_Hangzhou.webm","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/Grand_Canal_Gongchen_Hangzhou.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Charlie fong","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​京杭大运河杭州端起点，拱宸桥沿岸景观。画面上南下北，右侧为桥西历史文化景区。","width":320,"height":180}}